Evaluate only the defined, labelled scenarios and clearly disclose the evaluation scope. Do not claim that synthetic-data performance establishes real-world industrial safety accuracy.

If no machine-learning model is justified by the data, implement deterministic rules first. A clearly evaluated anomaly-detection extension is optional; it must not replace the auditable rule engine.

