## 13. Traceability and Auditability

Every important decision must be reproducible from stored evidence.

Implement an analysis-run record containing:

- Run ID.
- Started and completed timestamps.
- Rule-set version.
- Dataset/profile identifier.
- Input record counts.
- Output counts.
- Validation summary.
